      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p><em>Cebel-i \u1e32uds</em>: In the land of <em>\u1e32uds</em> (Jerusalem), there is a great mountain upon which there is a cave shaped like a house. It is a place of visitation for travelers and pilgrims. Every night the inside of the cave becomes luminous and filled with light. Yet the source of that radiance is not known. [translation]</p>",
